{
  "id": "om-mani",
  "title": {
    "en": "Om Mani Padme Hung (lesson 0)",
    "zh": "六字大明咒（第0课）",
    "bo": "ཡིག་དྲུག་མ།"
  },
  "kind": "mantra",
  "level": 0,
  "description": {
    "en": "The six-syllable mantra of Avalokiteśvara (Chenrezig), Buddha of compassion. A short first lesson that shows how the lessons work.",
    "zh": "观世音菩萨（大悲观音）的六字真言。短小的第一课，帮你熟悉课程的用法。"
  },
  "practiceNotes": {
    "en": "Recite while visualizing Avalokiteśvara (Chenrezig), white with four arms, radiating compassion to all beings. Each of the six syllables is traditionally linked to purifying one of the six realms of existence.",
    "zh": "持诵时观想四臂观音，身白色，向一切众生放射慈悲光明。传统上六字各对应净化六道中的一道。"
  },
